# For_Lenton

## Purpose

This file lists the currently open decisions, implementation gaps, verification gaps and documentation-release items identified from the current Karetao `main` branch.

This is a review/sign-off list, not a proposed resolution. Items retain the terminology and status of the current Karetao authority documents. A documented implementation gap is not treated as a new design decision.

